# Official CU CLI environment reference; NOT automatically loaded by cu.
# Prefer `cu profile` for endpoint/API version and `az login` for identity.
# If your shell or secret manager loads environment variables, use:

CU_ENDPOINT=https://YOUR-RESOURCE.services.ai.azure.com/
CU_AUTH_MODE=login
CU_API_VERSION=2025-11-01

# For API-key auth, set CU_AUTH_MODE=key and inject CU_API_KEY securely.
# Do not store real keys in this template or pass keys in command arguments.
# See the relevant tool README for unrelated Azure Language/Storage settings.

# Optional Azure Language PII helper only (these are NOT CU CLI settings):
# AZURE_AI_ENDPOINT=https://YOUR-LANGUAGE-RESOURCE.cognitiveservices.azure.com/
# Inject AZURE_AI_API_KEY securely if using tools/pii-redact/redact_pii.py.
# That separate helper retains its existing .env behavior; cu ignores these names.
